---LINES
var     = pvi   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
vari    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
varc    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "        " 
alt1    = paix  -       -       -       -         "YES"
a2      = aix   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipmx  -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv  - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga  - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm  - - - - " MSE "
VARi    = gvx - - - - " VAR "
ALTi    = gax - - - - " ALT "
MSEi    = gmx - - - - " MSE "

common  = gc  - - - - " common: "
page_n  = gc  - - - - " page navigation: "
specia  = gc  - - - - " special: "

---SCREEN                                                          
=generic keyboard actions (commands)
                                                                              
+ .VAR. line editing start:                        .page_n...............      
+     .:SP... keep content    .VARi                   .:TA... next line         
+     .:DE... clear field                             .:KH... jump to 1st line  
+                                                     .:KE... jump to last line 
+ .ALT. line altering:                                .:PD... next page/part   
+     .:SP... forward item    .ALTi                   .:PU... prev page/part   
+     .:DE... backward item                                                     
+                                                   .common...............     
+ .MSE. item selection:                               .:HE... get help        
+     .:SP... or .:NL...      .MSEi                   .:EX... exit/close page  
+                                                     .:NL... commit,complete    
+ ."in edit mode"................. ."with prefix".    .:CA... cancel             
+ .:DE... erase left from cursor                      .:RE... refresh page     
+ .:KD... erase below cursor       .:PR .:DE...                                  
+                erase up to end   .:PR .:SP...     .specia...............      
+ .:KH... jump to 1st symbol       .:PR .:AL...       .:KP... keypad on/off    
+ .:KE... jump to end of text      .:PR .:AR...       .:PR... prefix         
+ .:KI... toggle Ins/Ovr mode      .:PR .:PR...       
                                                    
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990, 2020-2024 vsv&team
---END                          

+."common"..........            .MSE.   .mse..... -------select menu item:
+."page navigation".            .VAR.   .var..... --------switch to edit: 
+."special".........                erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...

.specia...............        
   .:NL... next line,commit   
   .:PR... option prefix      

+ line editing start:                              .page_n...............      
+     .:SP... keep content  .VAR. .VARi               .:TA... next line         
+     .:DE... clear field                             .:KH... jump to 1st line  
+                                                     .:KE... jump to last line 
+ line altering:                                      .:PD... next page/part   
+     .:SP... forward item  .ALT. .ALTi               .:PU... prev page/part   
+     .:DE... backward item                                                     
+                                                   .common...............     
+ item selection:                                      .:HE... get help        
+     .:SP... or .:NL...    .MSE. .MSEi                .:EX... exit/close page  
+                                                      .:NL... commit,complete 
+ ."in edit mode"................. ."with prefix".     .:CA... cancel           
+ .:DE... erase left from cursor                       .:RE... refresh page     
+ .:KD... erase below cursor       .:PR .:DE...                                 
+                erase up to end   .:PR .:SP...          
+ .:KH... jump to 1st symbol       .:PR .:AL...      .specia...............        
+ .:KE... jump to end of text      .:PR .:AR...         .:KP... keypad on/off   
+ .:KI... toggle Ins/Ovr mode      .:PR .:PR...         .:PR... prefix      
                                                    
                                                    
+                               line editing start:       
+.common...............             .:SP... keep content  .VAR. .VARi
+   .:HE... get help                .:DE... clear field        
+   .:RE... refresh page                                                
+   .:EX... exit/close page     line altering:            
+   .:CA... cancel                  .:SP... forward item  .ALT. .ALTi
+   .:TA... next line               .:DE... backward item       
+   .:NL... commit,complete                              
+   .:PR... prefix              item selection:           
+                                   .:SP... or .:NL...    .MSE. .MSEi
+                                                                               
+.page_n...............         ."in edit mode"................. ."with prefix".
+   .:KH... jump to 1st line    .:DE... erase left from cursor               
+   .:KE... jump to last line   .:KD... erase below cursor       .:PR .:DE...   
+   .:PD... next page/part                     erase up to end   .:PR .:SP...   
+   .:PU... prev page/part      .:KH... jump to 1st symbol       .:PR .:AL...   
+                               .:KE... jump to end of text      .:PR .:AR...   
+                               .:KI... toggle Ins/Ovr mode      .:PR .:PR...   
+                               
